```bash
python forecast.py                    # Basic forecast
python forecast.py --backtest 5      # With backtesting
python forecast_continuous_72h.py    # Continuous future forecast
```

### Daily automation
```bash
python daily_runner.py               # Full daily pipeline
```

### Model fine-tuning
```bash
